# MNPS Job Classification Likelihood Scorer v4.0 – KSAC-AWARE SEVERITY ENGINE
[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/yourusername/yourrepo/blob/main/MNPS_Job_Classification_Likelihood_Scorer_v4_KSAC_Aware.ipynb)
## 🧠 What's New in v4.0
### Core Innovation: KSAC-Driven Error Severity Modeling
1. **✅ KSAC Embeddings** – Each role encoded via its competency keywords (TF-IDF over KSACs)
2. **✅ Similarity Gradient** – Replaces binary “in group?” with cosine similarity to nearest valid roles
3. **✅ Dynamic Salary Penalty** – Cost = `salary × (1 − max_similarity)`  
4. **✅ Adaptive Time-to-Correct** – Hours = `base × (1 + error_severity)`  
5. **✅ True Confidence Engine** – Confidence = f(KSAC alignment + justification + subgroup)
---
## Purpose
This notebook calculates likelihood scores (0-5) using a **risk-aware, KSAC-grounded model** that penalizes high-salary, high-dissimilarity errors more severely—mimicking real-world HR cost logic.
### Required Files:
1. **Evaluation Resources.zip** (must include `KSACs.csv` with columns: Role, KSAC_Text)
2. **Job Descriptions CSV**
3. **Classifications CSV**
